<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hershey said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hershey said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette downgraded Hershey Foods Corp to market underperform from market perform, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1-3/8 to 57.</p>
</text>
